# Output the tool itself writes, which lands in the working directory when it
# is run from a checkout: flash dumps and their .json manifests, partition
# dumps, merged images, the serial log and the partition-table CSV export.
# A flash image is device-specific and can hold WiFi credentials and keys —
# it must never be committed.
*.bin
*.bin.json
*.uf2
*.hex
*.log
*.csv

# NOT ignored on purpose: packaging/esp-flasher.png. It is generated from
# esp-flasher.svg (`make icon`) but is tracked, because build.py and
# build-deb.sh need it and neither regenerates it.
